      "In a Kadhi add tuvar dal, ghee, salt, turmeric powder, degi red chilli powder, bay leaf and mix everything properly.",
      "Now cover and cook it on medium heat for 20-25 minutes or until soft.",
      "Now add the cut roti and add kokum, jaggery, let it boil for 8-10 minutes.",
      "Now pour the tempering on it and boil it for a minute. Serve hot.",
      "In a whole wheat flour, gram flour, turmeric powder, degi red chilli powder, asafoetida, salt, oil, water and knead a soft dough and keep aside for 5-10 minutes.",
      "After resting, take a small portion of the dough and roll it into a roti and half cook it on a flat pan.",
      "And then cut it in diamond shape and keep aside for further use.",
